   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85236-24.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0024_trl-p1">
         <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>NYŠH Y hwlynˈ
	      <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>ẔNH BYRḤ mṭrˈ Y
	      <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>ŠNṬ $$-IIII-IIII
	      <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>mṭrykʾn Y ʾMYṭl Y
	      <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>hwslwdʾn lʾd GBʾ
	      <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>ṬWḆ hwlṭk pnyl
	      <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>II mnˈ grmkˈ
	      <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>K-#III-II gwcˈ
	      <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>III-II-C ḤS
	      <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>III-II dwlkˈ
	      <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>ʿL plsṭʾl
	      <lb n="12" xml:id="trl-p1-l12"/>ZY-š LʿYNˈ
	      <lb n="13" xml:id="trl-p1-l13"/>YḤBWNṭˈ ckˈ
	      <lb n="14" xml:id="trl-p1-l14"/>plʾdy ḤṬYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0024_trc-p1">
              <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>zan ī Xwarin
	      <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>ēn māh Mihr ī
	      <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>sāl 48
	      <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>Mihrīgān ī mādar ī
	      <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>Xusrōyān rāy kabīz (paymānag)
	      <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>did xwurdag panīr
	      <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>2 man garmak
	      <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>k(abīz) 5 gōz
	      <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>500 may
	      <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>5 dōlag
	      <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>ō paristār
	      <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/>ī-š pēš
	      <lb n="13" xml:id="trc-p1-l13"/>dād čak
	      <lb n="14" xml:id="trc-p1-l14"/>Frāy āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
           <ab xml:id="MP0024_trans-p1">
              <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>The wife of Xwarin
              <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>this month Mihr (7th month) of the
              <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>year 48 (699/700 CE)
              <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>on behalf of (rāy, line 5) the Mihragān celebration by the mother of
              <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>Xusrōyān the quota
              <lb n="6-8" xml:id="trans-p1-l6-8"/>again is 2 man of *cottage cheese*, 5 kabīz of *beans,
              <lb n="9-10" xml:id="trans-p1-l9-10"/>500 nuts, 5 dōlag (pails) of wine
              <lb n="11-12" xml:id="trans-p1-l11-12"/>to her maidservant
              <lb n="13-14" xml:id="trans-p1-l13-14"/>is to give personally. Frāy sealed the čak.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>